{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae About This Demo</strong><br>\ud83d\ude80 Jump into the first slice of <strong>Delivery Hero's</strong> with this free, hands-on demo of our open-city delivery simulator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this limited build you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Race the Clock:</strong> Handle orders from <strong>2 neighborhood eateries</strong>\u2014every second late eats into your tips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfcd\ufe0f <strong>Customize Your Ride:</strong> Try one <strong>Engine Upgrade</strong> for a burst of top speed and a <strong>Thermal Food Box</strong> to keep meals piping hot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26fd <strong>Balance Fuel Stops:</strong> Plan a pitstop at the lone gas station on the map\u2014or risk running out of petrol mid-route!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea6 <strong>Navigate Dynamic Traffic AI:</strong> Dodge cars, buses, and unpredictable drivers through a compact downtown loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea8 <strong>Dodge Police Patrols:</strong> A lone speed cop enforces the 35 km/h limit\u2014push it too far and pay the fine or lose reputation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udccd This demo covers our <strong>central district</strong>, showcasing core scooter controls, fuel management, and traffic-avoidance challenges.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864740?t=1752327148","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864740?t=1752327148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864740/d614802948856b2aa1012a3940ccf279f90ccfa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752327148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864740/d614802948856b2aa1012a3940ccf279f90ccfa9/capsule_184x69.